# Demo capture "mushroom-gorge" (tools/video/capture.sh mushroom-gorge): a 100cc VS race on
# Mushroom Gorge driven by the bot. demo-vs-start.cmds reaches the Courses screen on the Mushroom
# Cup; Mushroom Gorge is third in its list (see demo-vs-coconut-mall.cmds for the check).
script tools/browser-test/routes/demo-vs-start.cmds
click 500 430
wait 4500
key ArrowDown 150
wait 1500
key ArrowDown 150
wait 1500
shot course
click 500 430
waitlog 10 course 2 \(kinoko_course\) chosen
wait 4500
script tools/browser-test/routes/demo-vs-race.cmds
